# Warden of the Inner Sky, Plains and five Moxen on turn 1. Tapping three untapped artifacts and/or creatures (the Warden itself may be
# one, though it just arrived: it is not a {T} ability, CR 302.6) puts a +1/+1 counter on it and scries 1; it can be done again the same
# turn. The Warden has no flying or vigilance with one counter or with two, and has both with the third (turn 3), a 4/5.
# The first scry puts Lightning Bolt on the bottom; the second leaves Sol Ring on top, which is drawn on turn 3.

